    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 18 minutes, with his consent, because he lives with known threats to his life. He named a health care agent, recorded in the restricted chart and not named here, and wants full treatment in any illness or injury from which he could recover, with his faith and his pastor&apos;s presence respected. He asked that his wishes be kept private. The plan will be revisited in a year or sooner if his health changes. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
